{
  "job_B3.3.16_20251003_114659": {
    "text": "\u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6re \u00f0rowunge & \u00fe\u00e6re \u00e6riste & \u00fe\u00e6re wuldorf\u00e6stan upastignesse ures drihtnes, h\u00e6lendes cristes,\nIc \u00fea, \u00feeo\u00feimus, \u00feurh godes gyfe hw\u00e6thwugo on bocum geleornode & geornfullice smeade & sohte ymb\nBlinde he onlihte, deafum gesealde hernysse & deadum he aw\u00e6hte to life, & ealle \u00fea \u00fee on hine\nIc \u00fea, \u00f0eotimus, wilnode georne to witanne hu se eadega Margareta w\u00e6s wi\u00fe \u00feone deofol gef\u00e6ht &\nGehera\u00fe nu ealle & ongyta\u00fe hu se eadega Margareta ge\u00ferowade for godes naman & \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t geswenc\nSe eadiga Margareta w\u00e6s \u00d0eodosius dohtor; se w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6re h\u00e6\u00feenre hehf\u00e6der.\nDeofolgeld he wur\u00feode & f\u00e6dde his dohter; se w\u00e6s mid halgum gaste gefylled & \u00feurh fulwiht heo w\u00e6s\nHeo w\u00e6s geseald hire fostormoder to f\u00e6denne, nih Antiochia, \u00f0\u00e6re ceastre.\n& sy\u00fe\u00fean hire agen modor for\u00fegefaren w\u00e6s, of \u00feisan life se fostormodor hie miccle swy\u00feor lufode\nHeo w\u00e6s hire f\u00e6der swi\u00fee la\u00fe & gode swy\u00fee leof.\n& mid \u00fey \u00fee heo w\u00e6s fiftyne wintra eald, heo lustfullode on hire fostormoder huse to beonne.\nHeo gehyrde martyra geflitu, for\u00feon \u00fee m\u00e6nig blod w\u00e6s agoten on \u00feam tidum on eor\u00fean for ures\n& heo w\u00e6s mid halgan gaste gefyld & hyre m\u00e6g\u00fehad gode o\u00f0f\u00e6ste.\nSume d\u00e6ge, \u00fea mid \u00fey \u00fee heo geheold hyre fostormodor sc\u00e6p mid o\u00ferum f\u00e6mnum, hire\n\u00dea geseh he \u00fea eadegan Margaretan be \u00feam wege sittan & hr\u00e6ddlice he hire \u00fea gyrnde & cw\u00e6\u00fe to his\n\u00dea cempan \u00fea eodan & hie genoman.\nSe eadega Margareta \u00fea ongan Criste clypian & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00fe: Gemildsa me, dryhten, & ne l\u00e6t \u00feu mine\nIc beo nu, drihten, swa swa nytenu onmiddan felde & swa swa sp\u00e6rwe on n\u00ebtte & swa swa fisc on\nGefylst my me, min drihten, & geheald me & ne forl\u00e6t me on arleasra manna handa.\n\u00d0a cempan \u00fea coman to \u00feam gerefan & cw\u00e6don, hlaford, ne miht \u00feu hire onfon, for\u00feon to gode heo hig\nOlibrius, se gerefa, hire gehet to him gel\u00e6don & hire to cw\u00e6\u00fe, of hwylcum cynne eart \u00feu, s\u00e6g\u00e6 me,\nSe eadega Margareta him to cw\u00e6\u00fe, ic eom frig.\nSe gerefa hire to cw\u00e6\u00fe, hwylces geleafan eart \u00feu, o\u00fe\u00fee ic eom geciged.\nSe gerefa hire to cw\u00e6\u00fe, hwylcne god beg\u00e6st \u00feu?\nSe halga Margareta him to cw\u00e6\u00fe, ic gebidde me on ealmihtigne god & on his sunu, h\u00e6lend Crist, se \u00fee\nSe gerefa hire to cw\u00e6\u00fe, clypest \u00feu on \u00feone Crist \u00fee mine, f\u00e6deras ahengon?\nSe halga Margareta hine to cw\u00e6\u00fe, \u00feine f\u00e6deras Crist ahengon & \u00fey hi ealle forwurdon.\nAc he \u00feurhwuna\u00fe on ecnysse & his rice is a butan ende.\nSe gerefa w\u00e6s \u00fea swi\u00fee yrre & het \u00fea halgan Margaretan on karcerne betynan o\u00fe\u00fe\u00e6t he ge\u00feohte hu he\nSe gerefa hire to cw\u00e6\u00fe, gif \u00feu ne gebiddest \u00fee on minne god, min swurd sceal fandian \u00feines lichaman\nGif \u00feu me gehyrest & on minne god gel\u00e6fst, \u00e6tforan eallum \u00feissum folce ic \u00fee to cwe\u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t ic \u00fee onfo\nMargareta him to cw\u00e6\u00fe, for\u00feon ic sylle minne lichoman in tintrego \u00fe\u00e6t min sawle mid so\u00fef\u00e6stum\nSe gerefa hire het \u00fea ahon & mid smalum gyrdum swingan swi\u00f0e.\nSe halga Margareta bes\u00e6h up to heofonum & cw\u00e6\u00fe, on \u00fee, drihten, ic gel\u00e6f\u00e6 \u00fe\u00e6t ic ne si gescend.\nLoce on me & gemiltsa me of arleasra honda & of honda \u00feysses cwyller\u00e6s, \u00fey l\u00e6s min heorte her on\nSend me h\u00e6lo \u00fe\u00e6t syn on leohte mine witu & \u00fe\u00e6t min sar me me cyme to gefean.\n& mid \u00fey \u00fee heo \u00feus hig geb\u00e6d, \u00fea cwelleras swungon hire merwen lichaman \u00fe\u00e6t se blod fleow on\nSe gerefa hire to cw\u00e6\u00fe, eala, Margareta, gel\u00e6f on me & \u00fee by\u00fe wel ofer o\u00fere wif.\n& ealle \u00fea f\u00e6mnan \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r stoden weopen bitterlice for \u00fe\u00e6m blode & cw\u00e6don, eala, Margareta, so\u00felice\n\u00dees gerefa is swi\u00fee hatheortman & he \u00fee wille forspillan & \u00fein gemynd of eor\u00f0an adiligian.\nGel\u00e6f on hine & \u00feu leofast.\nSe halga Margareta him to cw\u00e6\u00fe, eala, ge yfelan \u00feehteras, ganga\u00fe ge wif to eowrum husum & ge\nGod me is fultumiende.\nFor\u00feon nelle ic eow geheran, ne ic n\u00e6fre me ne gebidde on eowerne god, se \u00fee is dumb & deaf.\nAc geleafa\u00fe on minne god, se \u00fee is strang on m\u00e6genne, & hr\u00e6dlice he gehyra\u00fe \u00fea \u00fee on hine gel\u00e6fa\u00fe.\n& heo cw\u00e6\u00fe \u00fea to \u00feam gerefan, eala, \u00feu unge\u00feunggena hund & \u00feu ungefylledlican dracan, mannes\nSe halga Margareta bes\u00e6h up to heofonum & cw\u00e6\u00f0, gestrangie me, lifes gast, \u00fe\u00e6t min gebed \u00feurh\n& gesend me \u00feinne \u00feone halgan gast fram heofonum, sy me cyme me to fultume \u00fe\u00e6t ic gehealde\n& \u00fe\u00e6t sy bysen & bl\u00e6d a eallum f\u00e6mnum \u00fee on \u00fee geleuat, for\u00feon \u00fein nama is gebletsod on\n\u00dea c\u00e6mpan \u00fea eodan & cwylmdon hire lichaman.\n\u00d0a bewrah se arleasa gerefa his ansyna mid his hacelan, for\u00feon \u00fee he ne mihte on hire locian for \u00fe\u00e6m\nEfne, \u00fein lichoma is gecwilmed for minum \u00feam egeslican dome.\nGe\u00feafa me & gebide \u00fee on minne god, \u00fey l\u00e6s \u00feu dea\u00fee swiltast.\nGif \u00feu me ne gehyrast, min sweord sceal wealdan \u00feines lichoman.\nGif \u00feu me ne gehyr\u00e6st, \u00e6tforan eallum \u00feissum folce ic \u00fee to cwe\u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t ic \u00fee onfo me to wife.\nSe halga Margareta him to cw\u00e6\u00fe, eala, \u00feu unsnotra, for\u00feon ic sylle minne lichaman in tintrego \u00fe\u00e6t\nSe gerefa hio het on \u00feystrum carcerne betynan.\n& mid \u00feam \u00fee heo eode \u00fe\u00e6r in, hio gebletsode ealle hyre lichaman mid Cristes rode tacne & ongan\nNe forl\u00e6t \u00feu me, min drihten, ac gemiltsa me, for\u00feon \u00fee ic ongete \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu eart dema cwucra & deadra.\nDem nu betwux me & \u00feyssum deoflum.\nEfne, ic sarige on minum witum.\nNe yrsa \u00feu wi\u00fe me, min drihten, for\u00feon \u00fee \u00feu wast \u00fe\u00e6t ic sylle mine sawle for \u00fee.\n\u00deu eart gebletsod on weorlde.\nIc \u00fea, \u00feeotimus, hi w\u00e6s f\u00e6dende mid hlafe & mid w\u00e6tre, & ic ges\u00e6h \u00feurh an eh\u00feyrl eal hire geflit \u00fee\n\u00dea eode ut of \u00fe\u00e6s karcernnes hwomme swi\u00fee egeslic draca missenlices hiwes.\nHis loccas & his beard w\u00e6ron gylden ge\u00feuhte & his te\u00fe w\u00e6ron swilc swa asniden isen & his egan\n\u00d0a w\u00e6s geworden micel leoht on \u00fe\u00e6m \u00feystran karcerne of \u00f0\u00e6m fyre \u00fee ut eode of \u00fe\u00e6s dracan mu\u00fee.\nSe halg\u00e6 f\u00e6mn\u00e6 w\u00e6s \u00fea geworden swi\u00fee fyrht & gebigde hire cneowu on eor\u00fean & a\u00feenoda hire\n& mid \u00fey \u00fee heo \u00feus geb\u00e6d hig to Christe, se draca sette his mu\u00fe ofer \u00fe\u00e6re halgan f\u00e6mnan heafod &\nAc Cristes rode tacen, \u00fee se halga Margareta worhte innan \u00fe\u00e6s dracan inno\u00fee, se hine toslat on\n& on \u00fe\u00e6re ilcan tide ges\u00e6h heo on hire wynstran healfe \u00e6nne deofol sittende swilcne anne sweartne\n& mid \u00fey \u00fee heo \u00feinne ges\u00e6h, heo geb\u00e6d hi to drihtene & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00fe: Ic \u00fee herige & wuldrige, \u00feu\nNu ic geseo minne geleafan blowiende & mine sawle anlyht & \u00feysne dracan acwealdne licgan.\n\u00deancas ic \u00fee secge, \u00feu halga & \u00feu undeadlica god; \u00feu eart ealra h\u00e6lende h\u00e6lend; se \u00fein nama\n& mid \u00fey \u00fee heo \u00feus geb\u00e6d hi, se deofol up aras & genam \u00fear halgan f\u00e6mnan hond & cw\u00e6\u00fe, \u00fe\u00e6t\nGewit fram me, for\u00feon \u00fee ic geseo \u00fee on forh\u00e6fdnesse \u00feurhwunian.\nIc sende to \u00fee Hrufum, minne bro\u00feur, on dracan gelicnesse, to \u00feam \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00fee forswulge & \u00feinne\n\u00deu hine \u00feonne mid Cristes rode tacne acwealdest & nu \u00feu wilt me acwyllan.\nAc ic bidde \u00fee for \u00feinne m\u00e6g\u00fehad \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu me ne geswinge.\nSe halga Margareta gegrap \u00feane deofol \u00fea be \u00fe\u00e6m locce & hine on eor\u00fean awearp & his swy\u00feran ege\n& mid \u00fey \u00fee heo \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00fe, \u00fe\u00e6r scan swi\u00fee micel leoht on \u00fe\u00e6m \u00feystran quarterne & Cristes rode w\u00e6s\nEadig eart \u00feu \u00fee \u00feone feond oferswi\u00fedest.\nSe halga Margareta \u00fea cw\u00e6\u00fe, wuldor \u00fee sy, Crist, \u00feu \u00fee ane dest m\u00e6nig wuldor.\nIc \u00fee wuldrige & herige, for\u00feon \u00feu eart halig & micel on eallum \u00feingum, \u00feu \u00fee gemedomast gecy\u00fe\nSe culfra \u00fea w\u00e6s eft sprecende & cw\u00e6\u00fe, Margareta, axia \u00feone \u00fee \u00feu h\u00e6fst under \u00feinum fotum be his\nSe halga Margareta \u00fea cw\u00e6\u00fe to \u00fe\u00e6m deofle, Hw\u00e6t is \u00fein nama, \u00fee uncl\u00e6ne gast?\nSe deofol hire to cw\u00e6\u00fe, \u00feu Cristes \u00feeowwe, ahefe \u00feinne fot of minan swiran \u00fe\u00e6t ic mine ban lithwan\nSe halga f\u00e6mne \u00fea ahof hire fot of his swiran.\n\u00de\u00e6t and se deofol \u00fea cw\u00e6\u00fean ongan: Manigne so\u00fef\u00e6stna man ic genam & ic gef\u00e6ht wi\u00fe him & ne\nAc \u00feu min ege ut astunge & ealle mine ban tobrisdest & mine bro\u00feor acwealdest.\nNu ic geseo Crist wunian on \u00fee & \u00feu dest ealle so\u00fef\u00e6snesse weorc.\nIc hig ableonde fram geleafan & ic hi gedyde ofergeotan \u00fea heofenlican ges\u00e6l\u00fee.\n& mid \u00fey \u00fee hy on sl\u00e6pe w\u00e6ron, ic com ofer hi & \u00fea \u00fee ic ne mihte of \u00fe\u00e6m bedde adon ic hi dyde on\nNu \u00feonne, fram anre gingre f\u00e6mnan ic eam oferswi\u00fed.\nHw\u00e6t do ic nu, for\u00feon \u00fee ealle mine w\u00e6pne synt tobrecenne.\n& me ealra swi\u00feost gedr\u00e6f\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fein f\u00e6der & \u00fein modor mine w\u00e6ron & \u00feu ane wi\u00fe me & wi\u00f0 eall hire\nCristes gefylgendum, \u00feurh \u00feone deofla magen eall to nahte gebi\u00fe.\nSe halga f\u00e6mne him to cw\u00e6\u00fe, saga me nu \u00fein cynn & hwa \u00fee gecende.\nSe deofol hire to cw\u00e6\u00fe, s\u00e6cg me, Margareta, hwanon is \u00fein lif & \u00fein lichama, & hwanon is \u00fein sawul\nSe halga f\u00e6mne him answarode & cw\u00e6\u00fe, Nys me alifed \u00fe\u00e6t ic \u00fee to secg\u00e6, for\u00feon \u00feu ne eart ne\nGodes bebodu ic wille gehyran & \u00fe\u00e6t gecy\u00fean, & \u00feu, deofol, adumbe nu, for\u00feon \u00fee ic nelle nan word\n& hr\u00e6dlice se eor\u00fee forswalg \u00feone w\u00e6lhreowan deofol grimlice.\n\u00d0a, on o\u00feran d\u00e6ge, het se gerefa \u00fea halgan f\u00e6mnan to him gel\u00e6dan.\n& mid \u00fey \u00fee heo w\u00e6s ut agangende, heo gebletsode eall hira lichoma mid Cristes rode tacene.\nSe gerefa hire to cw\u00e6\u00fe, eala, Margareta, gel\u00e6f on me & gebid \u00fee to minum gode.\nSe halga Margareta him to cw\u00e6\u00fe, so\u00felice, \u00fee gedafena\u00fe on mine god to gebiddanne.\nSe gerefa wear\u00fe \u00fea swy\u00fee yrre & het hi up ahon & mid kandelum byrnan.\n& hio dydan \u00fea nyxtan swa heom beboden w\u00e6s.\nSe halga Margareta \u00fea cigde & cw\u00e6\u00fe, nelle ic n\u00e6fre me gebiddan on eowerne god, se \u00fee is dumb &\nNe magon ge oferswy\u00fean cl\u00e6ne f\u00e6mnan.\nCrist sylf ge gebletsode minne lichaman & minre sawule he sylle\u00fe wuldres beh.\nSe arleasa gerefa het \u00feider bringan mycel leaden f\u00e6t & het hit mid w\u00e6tere afyllan & dyde hit \u00e6lan\n\u00d0a cwylras dyden \u00fea swa heom beboden w\u00e6s.\nSe eadega Margareta locade on heofonum & cw\u00e6\u00fe, \u00f0rihten, god ealmihtig, \u00feu \u00fee eardest on heofonum\n& mid \u00fey \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t gebed w\u00e6s gefyld, swa wear\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6r micel eor\u00fehr\u00e6rnesse geworden.\n& on \u00fe\u00e6re ylcan tid com an culfre of heofonum h\u00e6bbende beh on mu\u00fee & ra\u00fee w\u00e6ron alysde fet &\n& mid \u00fey \u00fee heo cw\u00e6\u00fe, amen.\nStefn w\u00e6s \u00fea geworden of heofonum \u00feus cwe\u00feende: Cum, Margareta, to heofonum; eadig \u00feu eart, \u00feu\n& on \u00fe\u00e6re ilcan tid gel\u00e6fde \u00fe\u00e6s folces xv \u00feusenda manna, butan wifan & cildan.\nOlibrius, se gerefa, het acwyllan ealle \u00fea \u00fe\u00e6 on Crist gel\u00e6fdon.\n& hi w\u00e6ron acwealde on Limes feolda, butan \u00c6rmeniga, \u00fe\u00e6re ceastre.\n& \u00e6fter heom he het acwyllan \u00fea eadegan Margaretan & mid swurde ofslean.\n\u00d0a cwyllras l\u00e6ddon hi \u00fea butan \u00feara ceastre weal\u00feas, & \u00fea an of heom cw\u00e6\u00fe, his nama w\u00e6s Malchus\nMargareta \u00fea cw\u00e6\u00fe, ic bidde \u00fee, bro\u00feor, gif \u00feu her Crist geseost, are me, o\u00fe\u00fe\u00e6t ic me gebidde to him\nSe cwyllere hyre to cw\u00e6\u00fe, bide swa hw\u00e6t swa \u00feu wille.\nSe eadega Margareta \u00fea ongan biddan & \u00feus cwe\u00fean: God, \u00feu \u00fee heofenan mid honda gemettest &\nGet ic \u00fee bidde drihten \u00fe\u00e6t se \u00fee cyrcan timbrige on minum naman & \u00fe\u00e6r awrite mine \u00ferowunge o\u00fe\u00fee\n\u00d0a w\u00e6s stefn geworden of heofonum mid \u00feunre & an culfre com berende rode & cw\u00e6\u00fe, aris,\n\u00d0urh engla m\u00e6gen ic \u00fee swerige \u00fe\u00e6t swa hw\u00e6t swa \u00feu b\u00e6de, eall hit bi\u00fe gehered \u00e6tforan godes\nGod ges\u00e6ttet on \u00feinum cyrcan \u00fereo hund engla, to \u00feon \u00fe\u00e6t hi onfo\u00fe \u00e6lc \u00fe\u00e6ra manna bena \u00fee to\nNu get ic cy\u00fee \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t englas cuma\u00fe ongean \u00fee & neama\u00fe \u00fein heafod & l\u00e6da\u00fe hit on neorxnawange.\n& \u00fein lichama bi\u00fe wur\u00feful mid mannum, \u00fe\u00e6t swa hwa swa ahrine\u00fe \u00feine reliquias, of \u00fe\u00e6re tide fram\n& \u00fe\u00e6r \u00feine reliquias beo\u00fe o\u00fe\u00fee boc \u00feines martirhades, ne geneal\u00e6c\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6r na\u00feor ne yfel ne se uncl\u00e6ne\nAc \u00fe\u00e6r bi\u00fe sib & lufu & so\u00fef\u00e6stnesse & blis & gefean, & n\u00e6nig on neorxnawonge mare gemetod mid\n& se \u00fee \u00feinne naman of ealra heortan cige\u00fe mid tearum agotennesse, he bi\u00fe gefreolsad fram eallum\nEadig \u00feu eart & \u00fea \u00fee \u00feurh \u00fee gel\u00e6fa\u00f0 & se stow \u00fe\u00e6r \u00feu to gefundest.\nCum hr\u00e6dlice to \u00fe\u00e6re stowe \u00fee \u00fee is gegearwod & site on \u00fea swi\u00feran healfe \u00fe\u00e6re eadegan Teclan &\nEadig \u00feu eart, \u00feu \u00fee m\u00e6g\u00fehad geheolde.\nCum nu, godes lamb, ic \u00fein anbide.\nSe halga Margareta bes\u00e6h on hire embhwyrft & to cw\u00e6\u00fe, ic eow bidde \u00feurh naman ures drihtnes,\n\u00deancas ic \u00fee secge \u00feu \u00fee me gewuldradest & gewur\u00feadest on so\u00fef\u00e6stra noman.\nIc hine herige & bletsige se \u00fee rixa\u00fe on worulde.\n& \u00e6fter \u00feam gebede heo hi up ar\u00e6rde & cw\u00e6\u00fe to \u00feam cwyllere, bro\u00feor, genim nu \u00fein swurd & ofsleh\nHe cw\u00e6\u00fe ne gedeme ic \u00fe\u00e6t.\nNe ic ne acwylle halig godedes f\u00e6mne.\nGod w\u00e6s sprecende beforan me to \u00fee, ne eam ic gedyrstig \u00fe\u00e6t to donne.\nSe halga Margareta cw\u00e6\u00fe to him, gif \u00feu \u00fe\u00e6t ne dest, n\u00e6fst \u00feu d\u00e6l mid me on neorxnawonge.\nSe cwylra \u00fea mid gefyrhto genam his swurd & hire heafod of asloh & gehwyfde hine sylfne & cw\u00e6\u00fe,\n\u00deider coman \u00fea \u00feusend engla ofer \u00fe\u00e6re halgan Margaretan lichaman & gebletsodon hine.\n\u00d0a coman twelf englas & genaman hire heafod on hira f\u00e6dmum & hi sungon & cw\u00e6don, \u00f0u halga, \u00feu\n& \u00feus singende hi hit ges\u00e6tton on neorxnawonge.\n& ealle \u00fea \u00fee wonnhale w\u00e6ron, healtte & blinde, dumbe & deafe, & hi on gehrinon \u00fe\u00e6re halgan\n& \u00e6ngla stefn w\u00e6s gehered ofer hire lichaman \u00feus cwe\u00feende: Eadig eart \u00feu & \u00fea \u00fee \u00feurh \u00fee gel\u00e6fe\u00fe,\nIc, \u00feeotimus, genam \u00fea reliquias \u00fe\u00e6re halgan f\u00e6mnan & ic hi ges\u00e6tte on niwe scrine \u00fee ic sylf \u00e6r of\n& ic hio geheold on sumes godes wifes huse, hire nama w\u00e6s Sincletica.\nIc, \u00feeotimus, w\u00e6s \u00fee hire ge\u00feenode mid hlafe & mid w\u00e6tere & ic ges\u00e6h eall hire geflit \u00fee heo h\u00e6fde\n& hire gebed ic awrat & ic hit gesende to eallum Cristenum mannum.\n& se halga Margareta gefylde hire \u00ferowung on Iulius mon\u00fee, on \u00feone \u00fereo & twenteg\u00fean d\u00e6ge.\nEalle \u00fea \u00fee \u00feis gehyra\u00fe on heortan beon bli\u00f0e & \u00fea \u00fee drihten Crist bidda\u00fe & on hine gelifa\u00fe &\nAmen.",
